# Delivery plan revision 1: accepted two-lane recovery and semantic migration gates.
project csm001:
  version 6
  title "Restore character authoring and migrate frozen ready V2 characters to strict V3"
  description "Execute accepted successor plan revision 1. Lane A closes the independent response-schema defect. Lane B rejects the permanent V2 reader and proceeds through proposed ADR, local implementation, deployment, dry-run, separately approved provider generation, owner candidate acceptance, per-asset append/CAS, readback and explicit schema-3 cutover. No task inherits authority for a later effect."
  as_of 2026-09-10
  duration_unit point
  velocity 1p/1d
  finish cm114

